{"source_slots":{"s4":"I think I'll go with the salt and pepper option for now. It's simple, and I don't want to complicate things if the other ingredients aren't available. But I might check the pantry again just in case. What do you think?","s5":"That sounds like a solid plan! Keeping it simple is always a smart move when you want something reliable.

Just a quick tip: since you're using salt and pepper as your main flavor profile, make sure you don't over-salt it!

If you do check the pantry, even just a little bit of broth (chicken or vegetable) could make a huge difference, but if not, the salt and pepper on their own will still make for a very good, simple meal! Let me know if you find any hidden treasures!"}}
